    fix(web): match the interactive run view to its prototype
    
    On a /flow-interactive session the run view's work area is the prototype's
    minmax(0, 3fr) minmax(0, 2fr) grid: Agents, Main, the timeline and the latest
    six stage runs (no Show all chip) on the left, Requests and Cost by stage on
    the right; each agent's status is its dot alone, its word kept as the dot's
    accessible name. The /flow and /flow-fast run views are unchanged. The four
    interactive card captures are now viewport captures.
    
    Task-Id: 15
    Flow-Key: task-15

